WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
If you want to travel to Maldives, hurry up and book your tickets.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,800
Men wear family members

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,800
Woman puts on her boyfriend

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,400
If any beautiful woman goes without someone to accompany her,

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,600
You can find me anytime

6
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,000
I will have a good chat with you about overtime in person

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Long live the boss after half a month off

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Boss, you are so funny. I thought I was looking for you.

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,400
Will you accompany me to the island for vacation?

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,400
It turned out that we had to work three batches of overtime.

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,800
Let me tell you some breaking news, Fatty, tonight

12
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,600
Just got 500,000 cash bonus

13
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,270
My brother's net worth will soon exceed one million.

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,470
today is a day

15
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:34,070
Zhang Tong earned a total of 63 billion

16
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:36,370
Earned a total of 63 billion Luo Min

17
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:37,370
Why do you make it up all day long?

18
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,770
These are mindless lies and bragging

19
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:40,970
If you don't feel tired, I feel disgusted and get out of here

20
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,570
I work overtime every day to earn a lot of money

21
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:44,570
Why are you teasing me with such exaggerated news?

22
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,970
Zhang Tong made 63 billion in one day, he really did it

23
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,570
I will apologize to you in public tomorrow

24
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,980
The frog in the well who won’t shed tears even if he doesn’t see the coffin

25
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,380
There will be times when you cry in the future
